      "writtenOn": "2026-09-23T01:52:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The E810 doesn\u0027t support firmware update over MCTP/I2C — Intel has confirmed that\u0027s not a supported path on this device. PLDM firmware update via pldmd therefore isn\u0027t an option for us.\n\nTo do OOB updates we go over the physical SPI line instead: E810Device derives from SPIDevice and writes the flash directly with flashcp through the BMC\u0027s SPI mux. PLDM is only used here to read the running version via `GetFirmwareParameters`, which the device does support over MCTP.",
      "parentUuid": "0bdb4854_b52382ef",
      "revId": "bd9b2787e3166f594af680fa0cf653757005e451",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
